<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=utf-8><title>Supervisor view — D9 20:59</title><style>
:root{--bg:#f6f7f9;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d2330;--mute:#667085;--line:#e4e7ec;--ok:#12805c;--warn:#b54708;--bad:#b42318;
--acc:#3b5bdb;--soft:#eef2ff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:14px/1.45 -apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}header{padding:20px 28px;background:#111827;color:#fff}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600}header p{margin:4px 0 0;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:13px}
main{padding:20px 28px;max-width:1280px;margin:auto}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(380px,1fr));gap:16px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px}
h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 2px}h3{font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--mute);margin:16px 0 6px}
.sub{color:var(--mute);font-size:12.5px}.kpis{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0}
.kpi{flex:1;min-width:140px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px}
.kpi b{display:block;font-size:20px}.kpi span{font-size:12px;color:var(--mute)}
.up{color:var(--ok)}.down{color:var(--bad)}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12.5px}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}th{color:var(--mute);font-weight:600}
.pill{display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600}
.p-ok{background:#ecfdf3;color:var(--ok)}.p-warn{background:#fffaeb;color:var(--warn)}.p-bad{background:#fef3f2;color:var(--bad)}
.p-info{background:var(--soft);color:var(--acc)}.bar{height:8px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;min-width:60px}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--acc)}.heat td{padding:2px 3px;text-align:center;font-size:11px}
.need{border-left:4px solid var(--warn)}.nav a{color:#cbd5e1;margin-right:14px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}
code{background:#f2f4f7;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px}
</style></head><body><header><h1>Outcome loop — supervisor view</h1><p>As of D9 20:59 (simulated IST) · one screen per workflow: what is being tested, what is winning, what we need from you, what changed today</p><p class=nav><a href='#nw_renewal'>nw_renewal</a><a href='#nw_kyc'>nw_kyc</a><a href='#ks_cancel'>ks_cancel</a></p></header><main><div class=card><h2>Loop health</h2><div class=kpis><div class=kpi><span>ingest lag</span><b>0 min</b><span>sim-time behind</span></div><div class=kpi><span>ingest throughput</span><b>18,773/s</b><span>events</span></div><div class=kpi><span>decisions</span><b>0</b><span>last hour</span></div><div class=kpi><span>credits</span><b>197</b><span>remaining</span></div><div class=kpi><span>open alerts</span><b>0</b><span>0 paging</span></div></div></div><div class=card id='nw_renewal'><h2>nw_renewal <span class=sub>· northwind_life · life-insurance renewal premium reminder (persistency)</span></h2><div class=sub>primary KPI <b>engagement_rate</b> · guardrail {&quot;pickup_rate_max_drop&quot;: 0.02} · config v11 · auto-apply schedule, caller_id · ≤3 requests/24h · approvers [10, 19]</div><div class=kpis><div class=kpi><span>pickup rate (run)</span><b>28.8%</b><span class=up>+5.0% vs history</span></div><div class=kpi><span>engagement rate (run)</span><b>55.1%</b><span class=down>-0.7% vs history</span></div><div class=kpi><span>leads concluded / uploaded</span><b>47.7%</b><span>11,000 uploaded since D0</span></div><div class=kpi><span>today</span><b>29.9% · 58.0%</b><span>pickup · engagement · flags 1.30%</span></div></div><h3>What we need from you</h3><div class=sub>Nothing right now.</div><h3>What's being tested (as of D9 15:00)</h3><div class=grid><div><b>welcome message</b><table><tr><th>arm</th><th>engagement vs control (90% CI)</th><th>connected calls</th><th></th></tr><tr><td><b>W1</b></td><td>1.000 <span class=sub>±0.000</span></td><td>18,170</td><td><span class='pill p-info'>control</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>W2</b></td><td>1.037 <span class=sub>±0.047</span></td><td>1,159</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>W3</b></td><td>1.002 <span class=sub>±0.049</span></td><td>3,923</td><td><span class='pill p-bad'>stopped winning</span></td></tr></table></div><div><b>voice</b><table><tr><th>arm</th><th>engagement vs control (90% CI)</th><th>connected calls</th><th></th></tr><tr><td><b>V1</b></td><td>1.000 <span class=sub>±0.000</span></td><td>15,706</td><td><span class='pill p-info'>control</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>V2</b></td><td>1.064 <span class=sub>±0.044</span></td><td>5,674</td><td><span class='pill p-ok'>ahead</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>V3</b></td><td>1.054 <span class=sub>±0.051</span></td><td>1,403</td><td><span class='pill p-ok'>ahead</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>V4</b></td><td>0.981 <span class=sub>±0.067</span></td><td>469</td><td></td></tr></table></div></div><h3>Live allocation by cohort (same cohort ids as the config and the experiments)</h3><table><tr><th>cohort</th><th>share of leads</th><th>welcome</th><th>voice</th></tr><tr><td>age 18-30 · lang en<div class=sub>age=18-30&amp;lang=en</div></td><td>7%</td><td>W1:29% W2:67% W3:4%</td><td>V1:10% V2:75% V3:15%</td></tr><tr><td>age 18-30 · lang hi<div class=sub>age=18-30&amp;lang=hi</div></td><td>13%</td><td>W1:29% W2:67% W3:4%</td><td>V1:10% V2:75% V3:15%</td></tr><tr><td>age 18-30 · lang ta<div class=sub>age=18-30&amp;lang=ta</div></td><td>4%</td><td>W1:29% W2:67% W3:4%</td><td>V1:10% V2:75% V3:15%</td></tr><tr><td>age 31-45 · lang en<div class=sub>age=31-45&amp;lang=en</div></td><td>11%</td><td>W1:29% W2:67% W3:4%</td><td>V1:10% V2:75% V3:15%</td></tr><tr><td>age 31-45 · lang hi<div class=sub>age=31-45&amp;lang=hi</div></td><td>18%</td><td>W1:29% W2:67% W3:4%</td><td>V1:10% V2:75% V3:15%</td></tr><tr><td>age 31-45 · lang ta<div class=sub>age=31-45&amp;lang=ta</div></td><td>7%</td><td>W1:29% W2:67% W3:4%</td><td>V1:10% V2:75% V3:15%</td></tr><tr><td>age 46-60 · lang en<div class=sub>age=46-60&amp;lang=en</div></td><td>8%</td><td>W1:29% W2:6